17. Error Handling

Define explicit error categories.

For example:

ConfigurationException
XmlParsingException
PathResolutionException
ConversionException
TransformationException
FlatteningException

Do not expose implementation-specific exceptions from the core API.

Support configurable processing policies:

FAIL_FAST
SKIP_RECORD
COLLECT_ERRORS

Do not silently swallow errors.

Every skipped record must be observable.

