36. API Design

Target API:

FlattenEngine engine =
    FlattenEngine.builder()
        .configuration(config)
        .build();

engine.flatten(
    inputStream,
    record -> {
        // consume record
    }
);

Also consider:

FlattenResult result =
    engine.flatten(inputStream);

but DO NOT return all records in memory for large documents.

Prefer streaming APIs.

